      "conjunction": "Every new agreement must fit both the bucket index and each primary/replica provider index.",
      "index_invariant": "BucketAgreements and every ProviderAgreements index are complete and duplicate-free for every unreleased agreement.",
      "counted": "Every agreement whose capacity_state is Pending or Allocated, including terminal-awaiting-release, remains in complete duplicate-free bucket/provider indexes and consumes both bounds.",
      "slot_freed_only_when": "Actual capacity release/removal removes the agreement from every relevant index; terminal status alone does not free a slot.",
